  biomeName: Fossil Gallows
  minDepthMeters: 3000
  maxDepthMeters: 3500
  shortDescription: Calcified branching bone-coral structures.
  isPlaceholder: 0
  visitPurpose: Transition biome. Come here to push deeper, find better materials,
    and work around bowls, pools, and local hotspots.
  commonRewardHook: Reliable value comes from Fiber Kelp and Membrane Tissue.
  rareRewardHook: 'The rare pull is real: Biolum Paste and Fiber Mesh.'
  landmarkIdentity: Fossil Gallows reads through bowls, pools, domes, and hotspot
    basins. Landmarks should feel large and route-defining.
  safePocketIdentity: Safe pockets exist, but they must be earned by reading the
    terrain.
  riskSummary: 'Main failure mode: localized danger pockets and hostile basins, then
    overstaying for loot. Creature pressure stays medium.'
  extractionFocus: 'Mixed salvage, harvest pockets, and risky reef-node peels. Mid-depth:
    expect basin pockets, salvage traps, and local hotspots, then return before greed
    stretches the route.'
  landmarkGuidance: Dominant landmark is reef crown or porous fossil wall. This slot
    should read through branching reef crown or fossil gallows; use bowls and hotspot
    rims to remember loops.
